          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "مانجھنا (māṅjhnā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin mā̃jnā, \"to rub, to clean, to polish\", under Sanskrit mārjati, \"wipes, cleans\" (CDIAL 10080)."
